		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=37030#p37030"><![CDATA[
App Game Kit is an easy, instant game development engine, ideal for Beginners, Hobbyists &amp; Indie developers. Now anyone can easily and quickly code and build apps for multiple platforms using AppGameKit's BASIC scripting system. With just a few commands you can have demos/games up and running on mobile devices.<br><br>Bullet physics is now built in to AGK.<br><br><a href="https://www.thegamecreators.com/product/app-game-kit" class="postlink">https://www.thegamecreators.com/product/app-game-kit</a><br><br>This video shows the character controller and ragdoll in action.<br><br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y1B6OzYVJGo" class="postlink">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y1B6OzYVJGo</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=10233">StabInTheDark</a> — Fri Feb 12, 2016 3:01 pm</p><hr />
